 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Start with warm welcome, maybe something as little as Hello and a cup of tea. A short reading or story about love and kind words from guests follow. A loved one or a close friend. They can even wear something special if it' a formal occasion. A simple circle of candles is lovely. And having everyone hold a small card or picture of someone they love adds sentiment. It gives a gentle feel without being cheesy. A small bouquet for the couple at the end completes the circle.",
